flowchart LR
    A[Source Code] -->|gcc -g -O0| B[Debug Binary]
    B -->|valgrind --leak-check=full| C[Valgrind Framework]
    C --> D{Tool Selection}
    D -->|memcheck| E[Memory Errors]
    D -->|cachegrind| F[Cache Profiling]
    D -->|helgrind| G[Thread Errors]
    D -->|massif| H[Heap Profiling]
    
    E --> E1[Invalid reads/writes]
    E --> E2[Use after free]
    E --> E3[Memory leaks]
    E --> E4[Uninitialized values]
    
    style C fill:#fff4e1
    style E fill:#ffe1e1
    style E1 fill:#ffe6e6
    style E2 fill:#ffe6e6
    style E3 fill:#ffe6e6
    style E4 fill:#ffe6e6
